  "updated_at": "2026-03-29",
  "bio": "Craig Lee is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Wellington, New Zealand, who specializes in unique designs that merge floral, geometric, and sketch styles. He practices his craft at the Union Tattoo, a well-kept and clean studio located on Willis Street. His distinctive styles reflect his talents not only as a tattoo artist but also as a printmaker.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Wellington, Wellington, New Zealand\n\nTattooing for two decades and I’m still here…..\nAuthentic tattooing at Union Tattoo, Wellington. @inkpro_nz pro team \nemail - iknowcraig@hotmail.com",
